{"ID":"20240513083347-s1k311u","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240513083347-s1k311u","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513083347-s1k311u\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513111207-dv21pf0\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513111207-dv21pf0\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513111207-dv21pf0\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:324,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:324\u0026#125;","title":"064","type":"doc","updated":"20240515123854"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240513111207-dv21pf0","Type":"NodeTable","TableAligns":[0],"Properties":{"colgroup":"width: 791px;","id":"20240513111207-dv21pf0","updated":"20240515123854"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableHead","Data":"thead","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪醫師病案紀錄"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 初診日期："}]}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"姓名"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"060-5 L, ML"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"性別"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"F"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"年齡及體型"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"50+ 瘦小"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診日期"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2008/4/7"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診原因："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"乳癌"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"，"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"進步中，乳房及腋下腫塊痛減。"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"問診："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1、 4月4日月經又來一點，4月6日又無，但今日就診時又有。(師：治乳癌，奶水化成月經來係正常的。)"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2、 睡好，夜間睡時無特別身熱。(目前無陰陽決離表現)"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3、 體力尚好。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4、 每日清晨一定大便，每日一至二次。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5、 整日排氣多。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6、 足熱。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"7、 身亦不覺躁熱。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"8、 額溫不燙"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"脈診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"脈稍數。"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"望診：\n1、舌診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"淡黃白點"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"針灸處方："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"合谷、太衝"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→①一般治重症，痛無定處，②使氣血旺→開四關。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"曲池、梁丘、肩井、足三里、上巨虛。(取穴之由見前案，此不贅述)"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"中藥處方："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"HT2(退乳丸) 6兩"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→病人告其退乳房已服完。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"解說："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"此人後背肩胛處有點往外凸，因受前方乳房腫瘤影響之故，此乃陰實入陰，女人背為陰，是不好的症狀。"}]}]}]}]}